{
  "label": "otohadorm5",
  "title_zh": "",
  "lines": [
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "label otohadorm5:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I knock on Otoha’s door and wait for her to answer.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I’ve gotten to spend time with her at[school] and in the park before, but...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "The two of us haven't really gotten to be alone in her dorm without any interference from others yet.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Not that I expect anything exciting to happen, but she’s proven to be excitingly...normal by now.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And, given that I spend my life surrounded by people like Molly and Tsuneyo and Ayane and...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Well, you get the point.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "There are a lot of strange girls in my class.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "So I shall wait patiently for this one particular outlier to answer.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I can no longer be patient.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Otoha, are you in there?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Mmph! Unn...sec!",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...What?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Mngh. Sorry! I was eating.",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Door’s open.",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I walk into the room and kick my shoes off at the door, hoping that I’ll wind up staying here for at least an hour or two so I don’t have to awkwardly put them back on after like five minutes.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "That has happened before and it has not been enjoyable.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene otohapajamdorm1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/otohapajamdorm1.webp",
      "alt": "otohapajamdorm1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Heeeeeey...",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Isn’t it a little late for you to be coming over?",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m already in relax-mode.",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You look very comfortable.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And hungry.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene otohapajamdorm2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/otohapajamdorm2.webp",
      "alt": "otohapajamdorm2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hahah...yeah...",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Nodoka’s at some bookstore with Futaba tonight and Rin’s playing some game with her other friends, so I figured I’d just...do my own thing.",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And your own thing is gorging yourself on doughnuts and-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wait, is that the sausage fest?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene otohapajamdorm3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/otohapajamdorm3.webp",
      "alt": "otohapajamdorm3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I was curious, okay?! You made it sound so...sausagey!",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Otoha’s first sausage fest...and I get to be here for it.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Niki would be so proud...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene otohapajamdorm4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/otohapajamdorm4.webp",
      "alt": "otohapajamdorm4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do you want something or are you just here to try and embarrass me?",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just thought I’d come see what you were up to.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You look nice with your hair down, by the way.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene otohapajamdorm5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/otohapajamdorm5.webp",
      "alt": "otohapajamdorm5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah? Thank you.",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I really only put it up because I friggin' hate how it feels when the wind pushes it into my eyes.",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Surprised it’s not like, too red for you or whatever.",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I mean, Ami’s hair is completely red and I haven’t gotten fed up with that yet.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah but Ami’s hair is cute and mine is just...hair.",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yes. Your hair is hair.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah, see? You get it.",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I don’t.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene otohapajamdorm6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/otohapajamdorm6.webp",
      "alt": "otohapajamdorm6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do you want a doughnut?",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’ll probably eat all of them if you don’t take any and I don’t think my body will like that very much.",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No. But your heart will.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What does that even mean?",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It means that you should do whatever makes you happy. And if that means eating a box of doughnuts and two pounds of sausage noodles, so be it.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Welp, I did pay for all of it...so I might as well go to town.",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh hey, are you good with technology by any chance? Because I can’t get this stupid TV to listen to me.",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What’s going on?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s just not doing anything when I press any of the buttons.",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Maybe the remote is dead?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The buttons on the TV aren’t working either. It’s just stuck on some weird picture.",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I think it might be frozen.",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Have you tried turning it off and back on?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene otohapajamdorm7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/otohapajamdorm7.webp",
      "alt": "otohapajamdorm7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just tell me you’re not good with this kind of stuff if you’re going to keep giving me generic tips.",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey, you would be surprised how many things can be fixed by turning them off and then back on.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I have tried that, Sensei. It’s just-",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You know what? Never mind. I’ll just keep myself entertained by talking to the old guy in my room like everyone else does here.",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I somehow manage to defeat a magical rectangle in the battle for a [young_girl]’s attention.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I ascend.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Couldn’t you have just played with Rin and the other girls? I’m pretty sure they’re right next door since Molly is like, the leader of their...game group or whatever.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I would have, but Rin seemed weirdly against me coming for some reason.",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m not that close with any of the others yet anyway. She probably just wanted to avoid things being awkward.",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Or she wanted to avoid you thinking she’s a nerd...which sounds a lot closer to what Rin would do if she’s approaching Otoha the same way she approached Chika.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The game they play is kind of weird anyway. We’re better off in here.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is it like, a video game or something?",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Not really. They all have these weird sheets of paper and talk in strange voices to one another.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene otohapajamdorm8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/otohapajamdorm8.webp",
      "alt": "otohapajamdorm8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Huh.",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well that definitely doesn’t sound like any game I’ve ever played before.",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Like I said, we’re better off in here where-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene otohapajamdorm9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/otohapajamdorm9.webp",
      "alt": "otohapajamdorm9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": SEVEN VIOLET FUNGUS APPEAR! ROLL FOR INITIATIVE!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Molly! Shh!",
      "spk": "Rin",
      "spkColor": "#FF00AE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Like I was saying, we’re better off in here where it’s safe.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene otohapajamdorm10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/otohapajamdorm10.webp",
      "alt": "otohapajamdorm10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I guess you’re right.",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Besides, I've barely eaten all day...so I should probably do that now anyway.",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well you...certainly have the required materials to do just that.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene otohapajamdorm3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/otohapajamdorm3.webp",
      "alt": "otohapajamdorm3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m a growing girl, okay?! And if I don’t eat balanced meals, I’ll wind up looking all tired and dead inside like that one teacher Nodoka has the hots for!",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The one that isn't you! The girl one! With the skirt!",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What exactly is balanced about your dinner, Otoha?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s got all the food groups! Sausage, pastry, soda! Come on, man!",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You have no idea what to do now that you have to provide food for yourself, do you?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene otohapajamdorm11",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/otohapajamdorm11.webp",
      "alt": "otohapajamdorm11"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well I obviously don’t think those are the real food groups, but...yeah.",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m used to my parents making dinner for me...so I’m stretching my wings and eating stuff that makes me happy instead of...green stuff.",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You poor, lost soul.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m sure I used to be just like you until I acquired a [niece].",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, yeah. Let me just go out and get one of those really quick. Great advice.",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene otohapajamdorm9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/otohapajamdorm9.webp",
      "alt": "otohapajamdorm9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ahh!",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s just your phone, Otoha.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You don’t actually get scared that easily, do you?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene otohapajamdorm12",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/otohapajamdorm12.webp",
      "alt": "otohapajamdorm12"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Of course not! I just...wasn’t ready for that.",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It surprised me.",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So what you’re telling me is you...got scared.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Shut up. I’ve gotta take this.",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hold your ears closed and...don’t listen to what I say in case it’s some...super secret business or something.",
      "spk": "Otoha",
      "spkColor": "#FF569D",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Right...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Otoha grabs her phone and hops off of the bed, nearly killing the sausage fest in the process.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Instead of exiting the room, which is what I expected her to do on account of telling me not to listen, she takes a seat on her stool and answers the call.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene otohapajamdorm13",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/otohapajamdorm13.webp",
      "alt": "otohapajamdorm13"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hello?...",
      "spk": "Otoha",
